# load-walk: "Load game in progress" with the saved game in fixtures/ (four characters on level 1),
# AdLib sound on (about 10,000 register writes). UP walks into rubble ("You can't go that way"); the
# arrows move without turning: RIGHT steps one square sideways, UP is blocked again, LEFT steps back.
option sound adlib
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
option insns 90000000
wait 600
key ENTER
wait 500
shot dungeon
key UP
wait 40
shot blocked
key RIGHT                # one square to the right
wait 40
key UP                   # blocked again
wait 40
shot walked
key LEFT                 # back in front of the rubble
wait 40
shot turned
quit
